dsh-everything-file
===================

Plugin code and the bundled NTFS indexer: MIT.

bin/MftIndexer.cs and bin/dsh-mft-indexer.exe
  Original work for this plugin. The indexer reads each fixed NTFS volume's
  MFT through FSCTL_ENUM_USN_DATA, keeps the names in memory, and answers
  substring queries over the named pipe \\.\pipe\dsh-mft-index. It runs as the
  dsh-mft-index Windows service (LocalSystem) because opening a volume handle
  requires elevation.

